    "updated_at": "2022-02-07T00:23:06Z",
    "body": "Bash does not source `.bashrc` when it is invoked as a login shell. If you want starship to run from a login bash shell, you need to do one of two things:\r\n\r\n- Also add the starship configuration to `~/.bash_profile`.\r\n- Add `source ~/.bashrc` to the end of `~/.bash_profile`.",
